      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's dark. it's actually hitting pretty close to home. i've been feeling that kind of pressure lately too, like what you said about the sunrises being cruel. it's hard to differentiate between his thoughts and my own when i'm writing him. i want to explore how he actually deals with that pressure. like, how does a person move past that feeling of \"crushing pressure\" if they can't actually escape it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
